\ ---- Behind the Shed ----

{ :name "Behind the Shed"
  :description "You are now between the shed and the lake, a position
                invisible from the house or the adjacent lawns. There are no
                windows here, but you can easily enter the shed via the door
                around the corner."
  :flags [< :room :lit >]
  :globals [ :shed ]
