           :south :south-lawn
         }
} :behind-shed :rooms place

\ ---- Shed ----

{ :name "Shed"
  :description "This small garden shed is filled with implements of gardening
                and lawn care. Shelves filled with various tools line the walls
                and a filthy window looks out on the lawn."
  :synonyms [ "shed" "cabin" ]
