\ ---- West Side of House ----

{ :name "West Side of House"
  :description "There are no doors or windows at ground level here on the west
                side of the house. A beautiful rose garden, separated by a tall
                fence, lies to the north, and the front of the house is to your
                south. A large lawn bordering the lake lies to the west."
  :flags [< :room :lit >]
  :globals [ :house ]
  :pseudo [ [ "fence" :random-pseudo ] ]
